{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13110180","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13110180","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1311018001:1":{"text":"从这座墓穴下去，沿着主墓道一直向前，就可以通往大教堂内部。","source_cn":"从这座墓穴下去，沿着主墓道一直向前，就可以通往大教堂内部。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1745FCC9ACFEB2CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1311018002:1":{"text":"这墓志铭，“卡列琳娜·拉季诺夫——她安眠于圣光之下，灵魂如雪般圣洁”……","source_cn":"这墓志铭，“卡列琳娜·拉季诺夫——她安眠于圣光之下，灵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB3EE65893B74382","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1311018003:1":{"text":"咦，卡列琳娜，这、这是你的墓穴？","source_cn":"咦，卡列琳娜，这、这是你的墓穴？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC316EB6D2DD555B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311018004:1":{"text":"没错，所以你们毋需担心惊扰亡者的灵魂，我并不在意这些。","source_cn":"没错，所以你们毋需担心惊扰亡者的灵魂，我并不在意这些。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7F39EDFB3212DCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1311018005:1":{"text":"谢谢你，卡列琳娜。","source_cn":"谢谢你，卡列琳娜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8441BACE7DE4828","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_ti